---
description: Morkahja admin tool rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Morkahja admin tool rules:

- Keep architecture simple and readable
- Use TypeScript strictly
- Prefer functional React components
- Avoid unnecessary abstractions
- No overengineered patterns
- Keep UI dark, minimal, atmospheric
- Assume backend is authoritative
- Separate API logic from UI
- Avoid storing sensitive data in browser
- Build reusable admin panels and tables
- Prioritize moderation tools, logs, metrics, and player inspection
